Patch-Source: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/commit/14249f8532cd1112673a3fe02065011707f19c29
Patch-Source: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/commit/2e9cc8bcc3277bd17bf817539d64fba3c8d693b7
